      TERM=linux).
    - Full arch/keys.md default key map (universal Ctrl map, selection,
      clipboard ring + OSC 52 write, undo/redo, TERM=linux Alt
      fallbacks, Alt+Enter multi-line, Ctrl+G guidance overlay, Ctrl+E
      named-widget palette, Alt+E $VISUAL/$EDITOR, Alt+Q verbatim,
      Alt+# comment-line, Ctrl+Q quit on empty prompt, Ctrl+\ cancel).
    - Bracketed paste interceptor (CSI 200~ / CSI 201~) so pasted
      newlines never auto-execute.
    - Child-process termios setup (VINTR=Ctrl+\, VQUIT disabled,
      VSUSP=Ctrl+P) with original termios restored on shell exit.
    - SIGWINCH redraw flag in signals.h/signals.c and zero-CPU idle
      poll in tam_tty_read.
    - Registered `bind` builtin (list, bind, bind -u).
  - Added unit tests (tests/test_edit.c) and C pseudo-terminal tests
